@startuml direct-rialto-monitor-av-health-state
title AampRialtoMonitorAV AvHealth classification (one sample tick)

[*] --> None : monitor created

state None : before first PLAYING sample
state Ok : position advancing
state Stall : position unchanged\n(normal rate)
state Jump : advanced > wall time\n+ monitorAVJumpThreshold
state Eos : getPosition() failed
state Trickplay : rate != 1,\nposition valid
state "classify" as C <<choice>>

None --> C : sample tick\n(PLAYING only)
Ok --> C : sample tick
Stall --> C : sample tick
Jump --> C : sample tick
Eos --> C : sample tick
Trickplay --> C : sample tick

C --> Eos : [getPosition() fails]
C --> Trickplay : [rate != 1]
C --> Stall : [rate == 1 and\nposition == previous]
C --> Jump : [previous == Ok and\njump detected]
C --> Ok : [otherwise]

note right of C
  Not PLAYING (PAUSED, FLUSHING...):
  tick returns early, state is kept.
  A change of state logs two
  MonitorAV_<state> lines.
end note

note bottom of Ok
  Never reached as a final result with Rialto:
  VideoFreeze, AudioDrop (audio slot has the
  same position, so it becomes Stall) and
  AvSync (video - audio delta is always 0).
end note
@enduml
